rooms_desc ({"This is Dillon's fine house.","the room is filled with practice weaponsa set of free weights and a bench sit in one cornerthere is a large open area for sparinggrizzly war tophies line the wallsthere is a large stone block in the center of the room","A silvery full moon lights this beautiful garden.  You are enchanted by thedelicate scent of cherry blossems blown in by the warm spring breeze.  A complicated maze of paths lead through the forest of crimson roses, but allpaths lead to a gazeebo in the very center of the garden.  You can not help butfeel in love.",0,0,0,0,0,0,0,})
